adership also important. Attitude concerns (show-off, not open) could be mitigated with training. Others have more severe interpersonal issues (nasty remarks, hot temper). So I might recommend Candidate C.\n\nThus my vote: Candidate C.\n\nNow produce public message: state recommendation, refer to no prior discussion (first turn), give evidence: anticipation, complex connections, leadership, but note concerns (show-off, not open). Explain why still best.\n\nProceed."}
